{
  "about": "reporterFollow (src/lib/reporterWait.ts) and reporter_follow (src-tauri/src/inbox/workstreams.rs). `events` is the audit, oldest first. `comments` (ticket comments with author and at) and `me` (the person's own account, or null): both sides pass as `replies` the times of the comments whose author is not `me`. `expect` is waiting (the since time, or null), changed (the wait ended because the ticket changed or the reporter replied, and the person has not chosen since), and replied (it ended with a reply, which implies changed). `repliedAt`, where a case names it, is the time of the comment that ended the wait (`followWithReply`, `reporter_follow_at`), null without a reply. `reply`, where a case names it, is that comment as `{ id, excerpt }` (`replyComment`, `reply_to`): its first line, evened out and cut to 140 characters; comments then carry `id` and `text`.",
